Herdr shortcuts
===============

`Ctrl-a` is a prefix: press `Ctrl-a`, release it, then press the command key.

Navigation
----------

- `Ctrl-a f`: open the session navigator; search or use `j`/`k`, then press `Enter`.
- `Ctrl-a h/j/k/l` or the matching arrow: focus the pane in that direction.
- `Ctrl-a Tab` / `Ctrl-a Shift-Tab`: cycle tabs (tmux windows) forward / backward.
- `Ctrl-a ;`: return to the last pane.
- `Ctrl-a w`: open workspace navigation; use `h`/`k`/`Up` for previous or `j`/`l`/`Down` for next.
- `Ctrl-a (` / `Ctrl-a )`: previous / next workspace.
- `Ctrl-a p` / `Ctrl-a n`: previous / next tab.
- `Ctrl-a Shift-a`: previous agent.
- `Ctrl-a a`: next agent.
